    "created_at": "2016-07-14T18:56:42Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-07-14T19:03:57Z",
    "body": "http://searchfox.org/mozilla-central/rev/e269c68bc594b4a858624d73f0d9eb002f3c0844/dom/webidl/Window.webidl#62 doesn't have the param for replace.\nAnd in case document.open is used for opening a new window, replace is ignored\nhttp://searchfox.org/mozilla-central/rev/e269c68bc594b4a858624d73f0d9eb002f3c0844/dom/html/nsHTMLDocument.cpp#1342,1348-1352,1393-1396\n\nSo, I think I'm fine with removing the replace for window.open case.\n\ndocument.open, when not used for opening a new window, needs to support replace, AFAIK.\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
